  {
   "id": "theme-the-eleven-tasks-and-the-scores",
   "name": "The eleven tasks and the scores",
   "summary": "The evaluation itself: eleven tasks, each a small output layer on the same pre-trained encoder. GLUE supplies the sentence and sentence-pair tasks, SQuAD 1.1 and 2.0 the span extraction, and SWAG a four-way completion. Each gets its own head — a linear layer on C for GLUE, a start vector and an end vector for spans, one scoring vector over four packed sequences for SWAG. Gains are reported as absolute point differences over the previous best, and this theme walks each benchmark and what BERT scored on it.",
